<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106850" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπαλλ-άσσω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπάλλ-ττω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>exchange,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				5.8.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Sol.</u>
				10
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θνητὸν βίον ἀντ᾽ ἀθανάτου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.37
				</span></i>
			; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μῖσος τῇ εὐνοίᾳ</span>
			<i>by</i> the goodwill, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				15.3.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>change a little,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.930c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τὴν οἰκείαν χώραν ὑπηλλαχός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					10.160
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λουτρὰ καὶ θυμοὶ κτλ. ὑπαλλάττοντα τὴν
					κρᾶσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.28
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				307
			</span></i>, al.; <i>alter</i> the text of a book, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς παλαιὰς γραφάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					15.21
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				16.679
			</span></i>, al.:—
				Med.
			, <i>change one's place,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.194
			</span></i>; <i>change one's bearing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τινας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phot.
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κωρυκαῖος</span>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπηλλάχθαι εἰς</span> . .
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				580
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν [βιβλίον] . . τινὰ . .
				ὑπηλλαγμένα ἔχῃ</span>
			<i>altered</i> (from the first draft), <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				15.424
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>mortgage,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρούρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					301.9
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PStrassb.</u>
				56.8
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr. in 
				Act.
			, <i>change gradually,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἀνδρῶν ἡλικίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					2.10
				</span></i>
			; of wine, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				15.629
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
